{"id":"a9cd9e1f3f8004cb","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-logic-props.md","title":"Modal Logic Propositional","display":"df-modal-logic-props — Modal Logic Propositional","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-logic-props","aliases":["89-df-modal-logic-props"],"display":"df-modal-logic-props — Modal Logic Propositional","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-logic-props"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-logic-props</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-logic-props — Modal Logic Propositional"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}props}\\vdash\n\\Sigma_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,0\\rangle\\mid p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\bot,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,1\\rangle,\n\\langle\\land,2\\rangle,\n\\langle\\Box,1\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}props}\\vdash\n\\Sigma_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,0\\rangle\\mid p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\bot,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,1\\rangle,\n\\langle\\land,2\\rangle,\n\\langle\\Box,1\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\Box}\\)</span> 明确记录每个构造子及其元数；命题字母与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 是零元构造子。算子定律属于定理而非这一定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-box-modality]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}props}\\vdash\n\\Sigma_{\\Box}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle p,0\\rangle\\mid p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\bot,0\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,1\\rangle,\n\\langle\\land,2\\rangle,\n\\langle\\Box,1\\rangle\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false}],"bytes"